  "answer": "Found the bug: `sum -= entry.amount` subtracts instead of adds. Fixing it now, keeping the exported `Entry` interface and `total` signature unchanged.\nFixed and verified — all tests pass.\n\n**The fix:** In `src/ledger.ts`, the running total used subtraction: `sum -= entry.amount`. Changed the single operator to `sum += entry.amount` so every entry adds to the total, as required.\n\n**Kept intact:** The exported shape (`Entry` interface and `total(entries: Entry[]): number`), and `test/oracle.test.ts` is untouched.\n\n**Test result:** `bun test` → 1 pass, 0 fail (3 expect calls), covering the positive case (4 + 6 = 10), the empty-array case (0), and the negative-amount case (−3)."
